     next to our reproduction of them.

3. Derived outputs in results/ and figures/
   - Our own computations on METR's public data: model-level statistics,
     counts, logs and plots.
   - The per-task extract results/task_anchor_classification.csv (task id,
     family, source, human minutes, human-time source) is NOT included. It is
     git-ignored and written locally by scripts/02_anchor.py.
   - PILOT-MEMO.md and the logs name a few tasks and their human times where
     the analysis needs them.

4. Quotations
   - Short attributed quotations, for commentary, from METR publications
